cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RAIA — Responsible AI Assistant"
abstract: >-
  A multi-agent, LLM-based software architecture that operationalizes
  Responsible AI across the software development life cycle, implemented as a
  working proof of concept: four agents in two layers (Product and Dev)
  communicate only through a versioned shared artifact repository, each runs a
  deterministic decision procedure before the model and validators after it,
  and every output passes a mandatory human approval gate.
authors:
